OL,3,GNEWSAFire at flats being treated as
OL,4,Apossible arson
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fire in the roof and stairwell at a
OL,7,Fblock of flats on the Isle of Wight may
OL,8,Fhave been started deliberately, police
OL,9,Fsay.
OL,11,FMultiple calls were made to the fire
OL,12,Fservice reporting the fire at about
OL,13,F13:00 BST on Saturday. Crews from six
OL,14,Fstations across the island were called
OL,15,Fto tackle the blaze.
OL,17,FThe fire left the entrance, windows and
OL,18,Fstairwell charred and a section missing
OL,19,Ffrom the roof space. The fire service
OL,20,Fsaid all residents were safely
OL,21,Faccounted for.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
